  {journeyIds:['LJ-14'],testId:'spoken-language',scope:'Actual playback module and SQLite/Wasm Route under controlled speech/audio: legacy playback follows active Route, while explicit Reference English/UK remains pinned after selecting Spanish. Empty initial inventory waits briefly for voiceschanged; timeout stays unavailable, stop cancels and settles without waiting for timeout and also prevents post-arrival late speech. Missing/unknown voice and synthesis errors stay unavailable, broken source recording is not replaced. Not actual sound quality or native device availability.'},
  {journeyIds:['LJ-13'],testId:'live-extension-language-matrix',scope:'Explicit paid/manual installed-extension acceptance on disposable PostgreSQL/API/Web and a human-authored in-page source: exact current Route and request language direction, real provider terminal explanation/translation, writing original preserved until explicit replacement, and explicit pending save acknowledged by Web Inbox. Device speech starts or reports actual unavailability without model requests. Success is a content-UI terminal state, not only HTTP/partial output. Individual runs and language pairs remain separate; not universal explanation quality, real YouTube, arbitrary site permissions or audible quality.'},
  {journeyIds:['LJ-13'],testId:'model-execution',scope:'Controlled actual model runtime/compatible adapter and semantic resolver: malformed proposal stays rejected, while diagnostic issue code/path excludes private source/output values. Generic queue, retry and stream guarantees are reused; not real provider output quality, installed permissions or an acceptance receipt.'},
  {journeyIds:['LJ-13'],testId:'extension-subtitle-surface',scope:'Current content script in real Chromium with controlled Chrome ports and platform data: cue/file/video changes disconnect old translation work; late file detection cannot change a newer track language. Oversized local selections retain the valid current file; live and oversized platform responses report their actual reason. Parser limits reject rather than claim partial success. Actual player adapter retains the selected French signed URL despite an English alternative. Not installed permissions, live YouTube availability, actual models or audible speech.'},
  {journeyIds:['LJ-13'],testId:'extension-intake-journey',scope:'Installed unpacked extension, actual background/model HTTP and shipped Web/OPFS: temporary page translation and explicit writing replacement, Escape/protected fields, current Route revision invalidation. A real Web glossary edit aborts held background HTTP and clears completed translations; new requests carry the edited directional glossary, removal retires that cache, and later edits cannot reopen stopped reading. Actual MAIN-world player adapter retains a selected French signed track; cue/file changes abort obsolete subtitle HTTP, real local detection keeps a self-supplied French file, oversize preserves it, video change removes the surface. Web Meaning/Inbox/Target/outcome counts stay zero for temporary operations. Model replies/platform data controlled, fixture origins pregranted; not live quality, live YouTube, full native permissions or audible quality.'},
  {journeyIds:['LJ-13'],testId:'extension-reading-surface',scope:'Real Chromium DOM with injected current content script and controlled runtime ports/detection/device speech: missing voice and unknown language remain visible; restoring before detection sends no reading request, in-flight work disconnects, late partial/result cannot return, current block language and Context stay distinct. Refresh retires old page cache/ports. Default input types work; changed drafts and newly protected fields are not replaced by stale previews. Not installed permissions, real models, audible speech or production site compatibility.'},
  {journeyIds:['LJ-13'],testId:'browser-port',scope:'Current isolated extension artifact injected into real Chromium with controlled Chrome runtime/model/device voice. Covers page/hover translation, known-language skip, dynamic Context, original links and restore, writing preview/replace/Escape and protected fields, page voice order/highlights/stop, selected YouTube track/local VTT/cue navigation and settings. This layered DOM baseline is not an installed-extension, live-video, real-model or audible-quality verdict.'},
  {journeyIds:['LJ-13'],testId:'extension-popup',scope:'Current isolated popup artifact in Chromium with controlled runtime status, route/site actions and queued outcomes. Busy controls prevent duplicate requests; failure re-enables them; narrow recent-list scrolling and site off/re-enable labels stay usable. Not installed browser toolbar, actual permission prompts, auth or provider evidence.'},
  {journeyIds:['LJ-13'],testId:'reading-skip',scope:'Actual bundled background/content helper under controlled native Chrome CLD and storage: reliable observations and declarations stay distinct from Route roles; unsupported observations stay unsupported, unreliable/dominant-unknown/native-failure results stay unknown, and short declared French retains its language. No installed extension, DOM, live model or language-detection quality equivalence.'},
  {journeyIds:['LJ-13'],testId:'reading-language',scope:'Pure current reading prompt/schema/digest contracts preserve exact source/target/support direction, third-language observations, writing direction and glossary scope. Not transport, browser UI or real-provider output quality.'},
